msgid "grinchBlizzard/descr"
msgstr ""
"Creates a close-range area-attack snowstorm around your vehicle. The effect "
"causes damage each second and freezes enemies for a short time. Frozen "
"targets cannot move, shoot, or use abilities."

msgid "grinchBlizzard/name"
msgstr "Frost"

msgid "grinchFlare/descr"
msgstr ""
"Shoots a color bomb at a position of your choice, marking all targets in a "
"large area. Marked targets receive increased damage, remain constantly "
"spotted to all other teams, and are more frequently engaged by bots."

msgid "grinchFlare/name"
msgstr "Flare"

msgid "grinchHeal/descr"
msgstr ""
"Creates a circle around your vehicle that heals and inspires all allies for "
"its duration. Inspired allies reload faster and have higher movement speed."

msgid "grinchHeal/name"
msgstr "Heal Aura"

msgid "grinchRage/descr"
msgstr ""
"For the ability's duration, your vehicle will have improved reload speed, "
"turret traverse, and engine power, but it will also receive damage each "
"second. Your vehicle cannot be destroyed while the ability is active."

msgid "grinchRage/name"
msgstr "Rage"

msgid "grinchRepairkit/descr"
msgstr "Repairs your vehicle's tracks and restores a small amount of HP."

msgid "grinchRepairkit/name"
msgstr "Patch Tape"

msgid "grinchStealth/descr"
msgstr ""
"You disappear in a cloud of confetti and cannot be actively spotted. The "
"effect is canceled upon shooting, taking damage, or being marked by a flare."
" The first shot out of stealth deals bonus damage."

msgid "grinchStealth/name"
msgstr "Stealth"

msgid "grinchTurret/descr"
msgstr ""
"Places a turret that spots and engages enemies independently. You can place "
"up to two turrets on the map. When you place a third, the oldest turret is "
"destroyed."

msgid "grinchTurret/name"
msgstr "Turret"
